concurrency is module
concurrency purpose "Run work in tasks and a bounded group, cancel one, and pass a value through a channel"
concurrency path concurrency
concurrency imports standard.console
concurrency imports standard.time
concurrency imports standard.channel
concurrency imports standard.math
concurrency exports main

stdoutWriter is capability
stdoutWriter purpose "Authority to write lines to standard output"
stdoutWriter grants write console.stdout none

showInt is operation
showInt purpose "Print one whole number on its own line"
showInt invariant none
showInt typeParameter none
showInt input value Int64 copied
showInt output none
showInt outputOwnedBy none
showInt raises none
showInt effect write console.stdout
showInt uses stdoutWriter
showInt memoryHeap false
showInt async false
showInt maxRecursion none
showInt label begin loopKind none
showInt label begin within none
showInt label done loopKind none
showInt label done within none
showInt let none
showInt at begin do writeValue
showInt at begin branch ifError writeValue goto done else goto done
showInt at done return ok none

writeValue is call
writeValue rationale "A test program has nowhere to report a failed write"
writeValue in showInt
writeValue invokes console.writeIntegerLine
writeValue argument value Int64 value copy
writeValue result none
writeValue ownedBy none
writeValue cleanedBy none
writeValue borrows none
writeValue catch writeError console.WriteError
writeValue suppresses console.WriteError.failed

Mailbox is typeInstance
Mailbox purpose "A channel of whole numbers between a producer and a consumer"
Mailbox in none
Mailbox instantiates channel.Channel Int64

